      "edition": "Wednesday 25 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Fan farewell",
          "heading": "Federico Ruzza thanks Udine fans as Italy fly out for Fiji rematch",
          "body": "Italy wrapped up their Udine camp with a final session at the Stadio Otello Gerli, home of Rugby Udine, before supporters came to meet the squad ahead of this morning's flight to London. Federico Ruzza called it always a pleasure to meet such affectionate fans, singling out the children who came for a greeting or a hug, and thanked Rugby Udine for its welcome. The Twickenham rematch with Fiji decides 11th place, and a win would end a seven-match losing run."
        },
