          "body": "Joseph-Aukuso Suaalii says he loves playing 13 because \"you get to be both sides of the ball\", and his return to centre has coincided with the Wallabies' uptick in form. Les Kiss used him on the wing in September's 42-38 win over South Africa, the first Bledisloe test and the heavy loss to England, before restoring him for Scotland and last weekend's 29-26 win over Wales. Ireland must reshape for the fifth-place play-off: stand-in captain Dan Sheehan is banned for two games, leaving a gap at No. 8."
